WEBVTT

00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:12.859
Harry.

00:00:13.651 --> 00:00:14.694
Aah!

00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:18.489
So weak.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.201
So vulnerable.

00:00:25.496 --> 00:00:26.581
Look at me.

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:32.436
Harry, it isn't how you are alike.

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:35.695
It's how you are not.

00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:38.092
Aah!

00:00:40.887 --> 00:00:42.388
Harry?

00:01:14.796 --> 00:01:16.256
You're the weak one...

00:01:16.881 --> 00:01:20.250
...and you'll never know
love or friendship.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.358
And I feel sorry for you.

00:01:50.373 --> 00:01:53.835
You're a fool, Harry Potter.

00:01:54.794 --> 00:01:58.624
And you will lose everything.

00:02:14.856 --> 00:02:16.184
He's back.

00:03:24.258 --> 00:03:25.927
I know how you feel, Harry.

00:03:26.094 --> 00:03:27.392
No, you don't.

00:03:33.521 --> 00:03:34.727
It's my fault.

00:03:34.894 --> 00:03:37.149
No, the fault is mine.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.942
I knew it was only a matter of time...

00:03:41.109 --> 00:03:43.345
...before Voldemort made the connection
between you.

00:03:44.987 --> 00:03:49.242
I thought by distancing myself from you,
as I have done all year...

00:03:49.409 --> 00:03:53.754
...he'd be less tempted, and therefore
you might be more protected.

00:03:57.458 --> 00:03:59.725
The prophecy said:

00:04:01.421 --> 00:04:04.353
"Neither one can live
while the other one survives."

00:04:06.717 --> 00:04:10.010
It means one of us is gonna
have to kill the other,

00:04:11.097 --> 00:04:12.427
in the end.

00:04:14.809 --> 00:04:15.962
Yes.

00:04:16.811 --> 00:04:17.966
Why didn't you tell me?

00:04:18.563 --> 00:04:21.060
For the same reason
you tried to save Sirius.

00:04:22.316 --> 00:04:24.309
The same reason your friends saved you.

00:04:25.611 --> 00:04:28.165
After all these years,
after all you've suffered...

00:04:29.323 --> 00:04:31.161
...I didn't want to cause you
any more pain.

00:04:33.661 --> 00:04:34.990
I cared too much about you.

00:05:00.646 --> 00:05:02.362
How come you're not at the feast?

00:05:03.149 --> 00:05:07.025
Lost all my possessions.
Apparently people have been hiding them.

00:05:07.862 --> 00:05:10.108
- That's awful.
- Oh, it's all good fun.

00:05:11.115 --> 00:05:13.547
But as it's the last night,
I really do need them back.

00:05:14.744 --> 00:05:16.101
Do you want any help finding them?

00:05:19.999 --> 00:05:22.061
I'm sorry about your godfather, Harry.

00:05:30.259 --> 00:05:31.555
Are you sure you don't want
any help looking?

00:05:32.512 --> 00:05:33.700
That's all right.

00:05:34.388 --> 00:05:36.516
Anyway, my mum always said...

00:05:36.682 --> 00:05:39.450
...the things we lose have a way
of coming back to us in the end.

00:05:43.773 --> 00:05:46.526
If not always in the way we expect.

00:05:48.528 --> 00:05:50.259
Think I'll just go have some pudding.

00:06:26.941 --> 00:06:29.259
I've been thinking about something
Dumbledore said to me.

00:06:29.986 --> 00:06:31.266
What's that?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.164
That even though
we've got a fight ahead of us...

00:06:35.241 --> 00:06:37.487
...we've got one thing
that Voldemort doesn't have.

00:06:38.494 --> 00:06:39.496
Yeah?

00:06:41.956 --> 00:06:43.590
Something worth fighting for.

